<title>USA: Mid-America sets stock, extra cash dividend.</title>
<headline>Mid-America sets stock, extra cash dividend.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE, Ky. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mid-America Bancorp, the holding company for Bank of Louisville and Trust Company, said on Monday it would pay an extra cash dividend of $0.05 per share payable December 13 to holders of record on December 2.</p>
<p>The company also said it would pay a three percent stock dividend on December 13 to holders of record on December 3. Cash dividends would not paid on stock dividends, it said.</p>
<p>Mid-America also declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.17 per share payable December 13 to shareholders of record as of December 2.</p>
</text>
